<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h2>
<p>Used by BioWare Employees to tag a bug or feature request on the wiki with the internal tracking number, and records the wiki user name.
</p><p>Copy and paste the following, replacing &lt;bug number&gt; with the EV bug number:
</p><p>
{{EV|&lt;bug number&gt;|~~~}}

</p><p>In the bug report include a link back to the bug here on the wiki so that end users can continue to provide new information and so the bug can be updated on the wiki if it gets changed in EV.
</p><p><br />
</p>
